1
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:06,460
Where have you been?
I called you three times.

2
00:01:07,260 --> 00:01:11,520
I know, I know.
The car broke down on the way back.

3
00:01:13,020 --> 00:01:16,740
You could have sent me a message at least.

4
00:01:18,940 --> 00:01:22,540
<i>My phone was dead. I'm sorry, all right?</i>

5
00:01:25,440 --> 00:01:30,060
Do you want something to eat?
There is soup on the stove.

6
00:01:33,660 --> 00:01:37,800
No, thanks.
I just need to sit down for a minute.

7
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:41,420
What happened to your hand?

8
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:47,120
It's nothing.
I cut it when I was fixing the tire.

9
00:01:49,320 --> 00:01:52,380
Let me see it. That looks deep.

10
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:58,520
It doesn't hurt that much, really.

11
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:05,480
<i>Your father was here this afternoon.</i>

12
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:08,500
What did he want?

13
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:14,140
He said he wanted to
talk to you about the house.

14
00:02:16,340 --> 00:02:20,180
I told him I don't want to sell it.
Not now.

15
00:02:23,080 --> 00:02:26,980
He thinks it is the
best thing for all of us.

16
00:02:30,580 --> 00:02:34,900
He always thinks he knows
what is best for everyone.

17
00:02:35,700 --> 00:02:38,580
Maybe he is right this time.

18
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:42,720
<i>Are you on his side now?</i>

19
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:48,580
I'm not on anyone's side. I'm just tired.

20
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:55,260
We can talk about
it tomorrow, if you want.

21
00:02:58,860 --> 00:03:01,860
Tomorrow I have to work early.

22
00:03:02,660 --> 00:03:05,840
Then we will talk in the evening.

23
00:03:07,340 --> 00:03:10,760
Did you see the letter from the bank?

24
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:16,800
Yes.
I put it in the drawer with the others.

25
00:03:19,700 --> 00:03:23,480
<i>We have to pay before the end of the month.</i>

26
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:30,560
I know. I will find the money somehow.

27
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:34,540
How? You said that last time too.

28
00:03:36,040 --> 00:03:39,580
Please, don't start again. Not tonight.

29
00:03:41,780 --> 00:03:45,740
I'm only asking because
I'm worried about you.

30
00:03:48,640 --> 00:03:51,400
I know you are. Thank you.

31
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:58,900
- Go and wash your hand.
- I'll get the bandages.

32
00:03:59,700 --> 00:04:02,280
<i>Where did you put them?</i>

33
00:04:03,780 --> 00:04:07,020
In the bathroom, on the top shelf.

34
00:04:09,220 --> 00:04:12,820
I found them. Can you help me with this?

35
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:19,380
Hold still. This will only take a second.

36
00:04:22,980 --> 00:04:26,940
There.
Now tell me what really happened today.
